<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE-Bahrain Commercial Facilities H1 97 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Bahrain Commercial Facilities H1 97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			(million Bahraini dinar)</p>
<p> Net profit		0.77   vs   0.61</p>
<p> Operating income	2.41   vs   2.09</p>
<p> Expenses		  1.74   vs   1.60</p>
<p> Other income	    0.10   vs   0.12</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity 16.87   vs   16.41</p>
<p> Assets		   57.41   vs   57.58</p>
<p>Full Name: Bahrain Commercial Facilities Company.</p>
<p>Note - Traded on the Bahrain Stock Exchange, the company is specialised in providing loans to individuals and firms.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
